{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f6a011e8-8479-5bbc-819f-db0af102141f", "source_ordinal": 1426, "reading_ordinal": 2631, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "突围", "published_at": "2024-07-30T01:53:39+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/7c52cbf84dd311efa48c52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "当然可以。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "但要注意方式方法。", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这分为两个路径：", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 24}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "第一个路径：由你所提供的面向全体同学的公共服务，绝对不要默认排除被孤立的人。", "char_start": 25, "char_end": 63}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "举个例子，你英语好，你表示哪位同学需要人陪着练习英语的可以约你陪练。这就是一项由你提供的公共服务。", "char_start": 64, "char_end": 113}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这时候被孤立的同学不来约，那不是你的问题，是ta自己的问题。但如果ta来约了，你给ta的待遇就既不要低于、也不要高于其他同学。", "char_start": 114, "char_end": 177}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这是你绝对可以做的，没人有立场来指责你“不随大流”。谁要来指责你，你大可以一笑置之，谁要因为这个来发动对你的孤立，就等于强令其他同学自行放弃这个服务。用不着你去反击什么，其他人——包括那些跟着这人来孤立目标人物的同伙——都会为这种剥夺ta们福利的行为感到不满，都一样有反抗的冲动。", "char_start": 178, "char_end": 318}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你不跟ta玩，我们已经讲义气没跟ta玩了，现在你要扩张到“只要不排斥ta的服务我们也全都要抵制”？那么老师拒绝停止给ta讲课，我们难道要**？食堂拒绝停止给ta午餐，我们难道要绝食？你把义气的标准扩大到这个程度，不是不可以，那你要付出足够的代价。", "char_start": 319, "char_end": 442}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而且我们也要对外反驳我们就是你的走狗的质疑吧？如果我们听话到这个程度，自己都很难说服自己不是你的走狗。难道我们就不需要人格尊严？", "char_start": 443, "char_end": 507}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "而你不需要特别在吃饭时去跟ta坐在一起，只是拒绝把ta排除在你提供的公共服务之外，已经极大的改善了对方的孤立感和绝望感。", "char_start": 508, "char_end": 568}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "而且你这样做，并不叫做“站在ta那一边”，因为你同样也没有停止对孤立ta的那些人提供对等的服务。", "char_start": 569, "char_end": 617}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这样，你就既达到了“避免某个同学陷入绝望”的目的，又不必陷入无休止的“评理”“调查真相”这类无聊的、无休止的扯淡之中。", "char_start": 618, "char_end": 677}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "我不知道你们之间的是非曲直，也没有做任何表态，哪怕就是这事就是ta错，我也不会因此特别的修改这个服务，把ta排除在外。", "char_start": 678, "char_end": 737}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "但如果你们来禁止我这样做，这就不是你们跟ta之间的事了，而是你们跟我之间的事了，因为你们禁止的是我的自由。", "char_start": 738, "char_end": 791}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "第二个路径，你可以使用被排挤者提供的公共服务。", "char_start": 793, "char_end": 816}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "比如对方数学好，对方也乐于提供数学的讲解服务，那么你不必因为别人抵制ta，你就自绝于这项服务。不然你们今天跟李裁缝不爽我就不能买新棉袄，明天你们对张屠夫不爽我就不能吃肉？", "char_start": 817, "char_end": 902}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "我的损失你们赔吗？你们谁来赔？你们要不赔，那你们有啥资格剥夺属于我的福利？", "char_start": 903, "char_end": 940}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "我把这个道理直接摆到台面上，质问一下大家——按这个逻辑，这些人何止在欺负ta，ta们还在欺负所有人。按ta们这个逻辑搞下去，所有人都要围绕ta们爽不爽来安排自己的生活，失去大量原本可以得到的机会和福利，而ta们却不会做任何补偿。 ", "char_start": 941, "char_end": 1056}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "或者说，我们得到的唯一“补偿”就是我们不会受到ta们的攻击。而这项“补偿”今天换了不准享受这个服务，明天又追加不准享受那个服务，后天又追加不准去抓这个机会……", "char_start": 1057, "char_end": 1136}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你总要有个尽头吧？难不成当成无价之宝，可以换无限的管治权？", "char_start": 1137, "char_end": 1166}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这样，我也不说我不认，但是能不能麻烦你们表演一个胸口碎大石或者大力金刚指，让我看看我这么大的屈从到底换了多大的一个不杀之恩？", "char_start": 1167, "char_end": 1229}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "被绑票勒索，绑匪也得让我跟我儿子说几句话确认人质真的存在而且还活着吧？难不成我仅仅通过自己的想象和你的宣传就卖肾交赎金？", "char_start": 1230, "char_end": 1290}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你们要是能当场发射一颗核弹，我看到蘑菇云了，我再考虑要不要明哲保身。看不到蘑菇云，那就麻烦你们先让一让，理解一下咱家的难处——我不针对你，但你也别为难我。", "char_start": 1291, "char_end": 1368}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "注意，这个公共服务的定义是有限的——对方提供的这个服务必须也是适用于所有申请者的。", "char_start": 1369, "char_end": 1410}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "如果对方说“只适用于那一伙人之外的人”，那这就不是公共服务了，而是“仅对盟友开放的服务”，那就不适用于这一条了。", "char_start": 1411, "char_end": 1467}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "现在你们看到“公共性”这三个字的特殊效力了吧？", "char_start": 1468, "char_end": 1491}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "不分敌我、出身、种族的公共服务，天然的享有超然的地位，其提供者受到自然社会规则的天然保护。仅凭这个身份，就能到极大的程度上避免彻底的孤立。", "char_start": 1492, "char_end": 1561}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "因为阻止任何人享受公共服务都是一项不分立场的反社会行为，连你自己的帮派成员也要腹诽生怨，这都是需要你真金白银去买单的，是有代价的。而且是这个服务存在一天，你就要再对全体受你禁止的人支付一天补偿。", "char_start": 1562, "char_end": 1659}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你支付不起，你的孤立自然破产。", "char_start": 1660, "char_end": 1675}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "而这一诡异的游戏规则却是这样的——如果你真的禁止得非常成功，对方就可以根本不必真的提供任何实际服务、承担任何实际成本，仅仅凭着一句“开放服务“的承诺，就让你无限的支出真金白银的补偿费。", "char_start": 1676, "char_end": 1768}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你越“成功”，你的负担就越大，对方的成本就越低。", "char_start": 1769, "char_end": 1793}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "小学数学都能算出你撑不到底，看懂没有？", "char_start": 1794, "char_end": 1813}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "这也提示了被孤立的一方——解套不要靠“我也拉拢一批私人朋友”这个方式，不要靠“我要搞新和连胜”这个蠢办法。", "char_start": 1815, "char_end": 1868}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "因为你要搞新和连胜，我反而同情你也不能来沾你的边了，因为我没有那个来自自然法的“享受公共服务无罪”的特殊豁免保护了。", "char_start": 1869, "char_end": 1927}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "你提供公共服务，我才好堂而皇之的打着“合理利己”的旗号跟你“公事公办”，你的孤立危机就自然解除了。否则我就没有这层逻辑护甲可用，被人攻击“和你私相授受”，我就没法借助自然法组织最广泛的统一战线去瓦解敌人。", "char_start": 1928, "char_end": 2030}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "那就恕我要置身事外了。", "char_start": 2031, "char_end": 2042}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "话又说回来——如果你并不提供任何公共服务，我为什么平白无故的“冒险犯难，挺身而出”？", "char_start": 2044, "char_end": 2086}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "我自己可是公共服务的提供者，我对这个社会本来就比一般人贵重，我其实有责任不轻易为了某种自义的冲动轻易涉险，你看懂没有？", "char_start": 2087, "char_end": 2146}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "否则我本身就在伤害社会总福利。", "char_start": 2147, "char_end": 2162}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "在这个条件下，我就只能做到“不把你排除在我的服务之外”。", "char_start": 2163, "char_end": 2191}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "这对你是单向的，其实是不够的，你懂不懂？", "char_start": 2192, "char_end": 2212}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "如果你能全盘看懂，你就能连第二条路都打通。我们的“互相服务关系”就已经足够解除你的围城之苦。", "char_start": 2213, "char_end": 2259}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "尽管到这一步还谈不上私交、谈不上有特殊的亲密关系，但这已经非常有效了。", "char_start": 2260, "char_end": 2295}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "这是自然法做担保的脱困之法，你能用好，除非掉到无人荒岛上，否则基本上不太可能被长期完全孤立。", "char_start": 2297, "char_end": 2343}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 48}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0384"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：能和被孤立的人玩吗?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044"], "summary": "围绕“突围”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“当然可以。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "当然可以。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "af71814b-e928-51d4-8e65-4664e4e0ae8b", "source_ordinal": 1425, "reading_ordinal": 2632, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "长不大的社会", "published_at": "2024-07-30T08:46:18+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/367810884/answer/3577859380"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你们没发现吗？这个社会有一种非常不健康的倾向，就是喜欢诅咒一些关系。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 34}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "比如继母和继子女。比如养子和有了亲生子女的养父母。比如叔叔和继承人。比如嫡子和庶子。比如正妻和姬妾。", "char_start": 35, "char_end": 85}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "是的，这些关系非常艰难。这些关系经常失败，十之八九失败。失败之后常常给周围的人带来附带的痛苦。", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "所以这些关系就是“不祥”的。", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 148}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因为ta们给“完美的社会结构”造成了“意外”。就像一辆五轮车、一只六根手指的手、三根柱子的房间。ta们让原本简单的社会法则多出了尴尬的、额外的家庭作业，而社会成员们要维护所谓理想格式的基本作业就已经精疲力竭了。", "char_start": 149, "char_end": 254}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "其实这些人是无辜的，ta们原本就是完美的社会结构的一部分，但是出了意外，原本属于ta们的三口之家残缺了、重组了。重组之后，ta们一下就多余了。", "char_start": 255, "char_end": 326}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "那些弟弟们，为了防止嫡长子夭折，作为备份存在。嫡长子没有夭折，ta们的使命就结束了，ta们的存在就多余了。", "char_start": 327, "char_end": 380}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "“社会”并没有给ta们安排“退休计划”，没有一套准备好的手册教ta们接下来应该怎么做、教所有人应该如何对待ta们。", "char_start": 381, "char_end": 438}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "历史甚至都没有费神为ta们准备足够的参考案例。", "char_start": 439, "char_end": 462}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "来，你们谁来列举几个成功的继母继子的传奇？谁来举一点王叔和幼弟的美好结局？真的没发生过吗？还是其实也有发生，但是出于某种神秘的原因，这些美好的故事被有意无意的遗忘了？", "char_start": 463, "char_end": 546}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "人们似乎在期待、在盼望这些被诅咒的的关系崩塌。", "char_start": 547, "char_end": 570}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "哪怕ta们明知当事人是无辜的，ta们也在默不作声的推挤、拉扯、躲在人群中难以被追踪、难以被追责的挑衅、刺激这些无辜的当事人。用无数看似无心的“无关议论”让ta们对好结果、好期盼绝望，充满怨毒，然后冲着这些怨毒塑造的、无处可逃、步步紧逼的幻魔发动攻击。", "char_start": 571, "char_end": 696}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "然后当场把主动发动攻击的“邪恶的”ta们抓住，大快人心的处决。", "char_start": 697, "char_end": 728}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这个方案可比把基于标准条件编纂的“最佳社会实践指南”为了这些数量稀少的罕见异常多扩编出额外的三卷补充手册成本低多了。", "char_start": 729, "char_end": 787}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "不是吗？", "char_start": 788, "char_end": 792}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "社会先抛弃ta们，然后ta们报复社会，然后社会再挥起正义的铁拳，将ta们消灭。", "char_start": 793, "char_end": 832}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "Nice and clean, right?", "char_start": 833, "char_end": 855}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "人类社会化最大的奇妙悖论在于——社会本身并不是完美的社会化范例。", "char_start": 856, "char_end": 888}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "看明白了吗？", "char_start": 889, "char_end": 895}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "社会自身如果是一个有人格的人类，它本身有着相当残酷、冷漠、恶毒的一面。", "char_start": 896, "char_end": 931}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "它自己反而像是一位未经充分教育、野性未驯而且肆意妄为的青少年。即使已经几千岁——甚至几十万岁了，仍然兽血沸腾、劣性未除。", "char_start": 932, "char_end": 992}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "它仍然会利用自己的强大的特殊权柄，驱使着茫然无知的社会成员，去做很多其实对社会成员自身不利——甚至对它自身的长远利益也不利——但却顺应它自己的兽性本能的事。", "char_start": 993, "char_end": 1071}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "对继养、收养、嫡庶、正备关系有意无意的残害就是人类社会尚未完成的演化之一。", "char_start": 1072, "char_end": 1109}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你们都是理智的人类，相信一旦清晰的指出来，一个良知稍微正常的人都会意识到无意识的参与到对这些不幸的人的“希望剥夺”中去实际上不是一种“老练的智慧”、一种“tough love”。", "char_start": 1110, "char_end": 1199}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "而是一种难以言喻的对社会之恶的胁从。", "char_start": 1200, "char_end": 1218}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "不是吗？", "char_start": 1219, "char_end": 1223}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "为什么我们要用这么多所谓的“洞见”“阅历”不厌其烦的告诉继子们“得到继母真实的爱根本是不可能的”？去告诉继母们“得到继子女们真正的感激是不可能的”？近乎不眠不休的要去培养ta们对“无论看上去多么像真的，本质上ta们一定在算计你”的确信？", "char_start": 1224, "char_end": 1342}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "我们为什么一定要这么做？我们为什么如此确信这么做是对这些当事人的一种“照顾”？一种“善意提醒”？", "char_start": 1343, "char_end": 1391}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "为什么让ta们对获得爱的可能绝望反而是爱ta们？", "char_start": 1392, "char_end": 1416}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "我们有没有想过，ta们很少得到这份渺茫的爱这个所谓的“历史事实”，有我们这海量的、自以为善意的“提前警告”的巨大影响？", "char_start": 1417, "char_end": 1476}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "如果不是人人都在不眠不休的、孜孜不倦的告诉双方“这绝不可能”，ta们得到爱的概率真的会像历史数据显示的那样渺茫吗？", "char_start": 1477, "char_end": 1534}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "我们就像一群横冲直撞的酒鬼，通过自己的横冲直撞在证明“遵守交通规则没有意义”。", "char_start": 1535, "char_end": 1574}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "我们自己实施了这些诅咒，然后打着“让你提前接受现实”的“为你好”的旗号，让你接受诅咒。", "char_start": 1575, "char_end": 1618}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "一个自我实现的诅咒。", "char_start": 1619, "char_end": 1629}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "多么完美的“逻辑闭环”啊。", "char_start": 1630, "char_end": 1643}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "看看这个问题下如洪水般泛滥的各种“亲眼所见的前车之鉴”，仿佛让这双方的任何一方对这种关系可能有好结果、好可能有一丁点残留的期望都是在作孽。", "char_start": 1644, "char_end": 1713}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "不是吗？", "char_start": 1714, "char_end": 1718}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "是啊，不要有一点指望，还是老老实实的按照社会所希望的那样互相憎恨，然后再为ta们增加一个新的“我早料到”的例证，让一切继续。", "char_start": 1719, "char_end": 1781}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "是要这样吗？", "char_start": 1782, "char_end": 1788}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "人的社会化不是简单的顺从社会的一切驱使，而是有比简单的“顺从社会的现状”更高的目标。", "char_start": 1790, "char_end": 1832}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "这其中要尤其警惕社会自身内蕴的问题，警惕社会自身的天然局限，这种“对非规范关系的本能摧残”就是经典的例子之一。", "char_start": 1833, "char_end": 1888}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "以前你不知道，现在你知道了。", "char_start": 1889, "char_end": 1903}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "不要做社会本能的傀儡——一旦你醒了，你会发现社会自己的心理年龄其实也不大——推动社会去做正确的改变，也是你的责任之一。", "char_start": 1904, "char_end": 1963}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "你是社会的成员，也是社会的主人和向导。", "char_start": 1964, "char_end": 1983}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "你要适应它，你有适应它的义务。", "char_start": 1984, "char_end": 1999}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "但你一旦成熟了，它也要适应你，它也有适应你的义务。", "char_start": 2000, "char_end": 2025}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 48}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0384"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：后妈对孩子的恶意到底出自何处？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046"], "summary": "围绕“长不大的社会”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你们没发现吗？这个社会有一种非常不健康的倾向，就是喜欢诅咒一些关系。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你们没发现吗？这个社会有一种非常不健康的倾向，就是喜欢诅咒一些关系。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 34, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5b64d047-66c0-52fe-8f67-96996fdc2e1f", "source_ordinal": 1424, "reading_ordinal": 2633, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "走钢丝的食神", "published_at": "2024-07-30T23:00:49+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/662798073/answer/3578766375"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "当众发表演讲是一个对社会化程度要求非常高的操作，和杂技表演一样是需要功夫的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "学校往往会犯一种低级错误，就是以为考试分数高的学生似乎不需要经过任何教育和训练就可以胜任这种工作。", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 88}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "ta们的思路很简单，学生考试考得好，于是奖励ta上台讲话。但这个想法就像一个人擅长炒菜，因为菜炒得太好了，于是村里决定“奖励”ta去表演一次走钢丝。", "char_start": 89, "char_end": 163}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "走就罢了，还不培训，不练习，也不系保险绳。结果师傅从钢丝上摔下来了，腿都摔折了，演出也搞砸了。", "char_start": 164, "char_end": 211}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "上哪说理去？", "char_start": 212, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "炒菜是炒菜，走钢丝是走钢丝。不是不能请炒菜的师傅去走钢丝，但是你也不能简单的认为“这根钢丝离地也就一尺半，摔不死人”就认定炒菜师傅走它没问题。", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "请谁在你自己看重的仪式上讲话，就是在这个人身上投入了重大的社会资本，涉及到全校教职员工的名誉和品牌，这份投资折合人民币就以十万、百万计。", "char_start": 291, "char_end": 359}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "掂量这份投资能不能投给这个操盘手，要如同看待真金白银的交易。", "char_start": 360, "char_end": 390}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果这是一百万人民币，学校还会给这位这么轻浮的处置吗？", "char_start": 391, "char_end": 418}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "在选择人选的时候还会搞“炒菜好吃，钢丝想必也走得很帅”这种“行为艺术”吗？", "char_start": 419, "char_end": 456}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "代你演讲的人如果不能正确的估计自己身上背负的社会资本投资额度，无论ta的技巧如何，都是绝不能与之交易的。", "char_start": 457, "char_end": 509}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "学校自己没这根弦，付小儿以白璧行于闹市，摔缺了角，只能自己接受教训。", "char_start": 510, "char_end": 544}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "演讲要交给社会化程度与演讲需求相称的人去做，不要“学而优则讲”。", "char_start": 545, "char_end": 577}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "否则闹出事情只能自己兜着。", "char_start": 578, "char_end": 591}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 16}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0384"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：毕业生戏称学校「牛马一中」被赶下台，校长和学校该怎样对待自己的学生？此事对社会造成了怎样的影响？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“走钢丝的食神”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“当众发表演讲是一个对社会化程度要求非常高的操作，和杂技表演一样是需要功夫的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "当众发表演讲是一个对社会化程度要求非常高的操作，和杂技表演一样是需要功夫的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2da5affb-8676-5e3a-ba04-0967e27b981d", "source_ordinal": 1423, "reading_ordinal": 2634, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "无路可退", "published_at": "2024-07-31T05:29:41+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/624250491/answer/3578916550"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "很明显的一点是，你不是“不论咋样也不想去违法的地方呆着”，而是“哪怕去违法的地方呆着也不要上学、按时写作业、放弃威胁家长”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 62}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你不是单纯的是想问一个办法可以避免去网瘾学校，而是要一个办法，可以既避免去网瘾学校，又不用上学、不用写作业。", "char_start": 63, "char_end": 117}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "否则把这几条改变不就不用去了吗？", "char_start": 118, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "为啥这几条这么重要？以至于只能讨论去不去网瘾中心，而不能讨论这几条要不要停止？", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "网瘾中心可不便宜，一个月少说也有六七千人民币，贵起来更是几万几万的。而且父母也不是白痴、当然知道这对亲子关系是一个可怕的冒险，要是没成功，这个儿子/女儿大概率恨自己一辈子。甚至就算是成功了，怕也要恨一辈子。", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 278}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这跟父母在你眼里看来有多邪恶、变态没啥关系，再邪恶、再变态的人，钱也得一手一脚去赚啊。", "char_start": 279, "char_end": 322}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "如果存在什么别的代价更低、风险更小的解决“不上学、不写作业、不尊重家庭伦理”问题的选择，很难想象父母会凭空的要去付这么大的代价、冒这么大的风险。", "char_start": 323, "char_end": 395}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "所以，真正的问题是——为什么宁可去网瘾中心也不写作业？不上学？", "char_start": 396, "char_end": 427}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果是学校不好、老师不好，你可以提出换学校、换班，这对父母也比送你去网瘾中心更值得一试。这类可以妥协的、对父母更好接受的尝试其实很多。", "char_start": 428, "char_end": 495}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "很难想象父母会没有提出过这些提议，直接跳跃到严肃的准备送网瘾中心。", "char_start": 496, "char_end": 529}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这些“其他提议”是经过了什么样的过程而一一被认为“不可行”的？", "char_start": 530, "char_end": 561}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这个事态不断升级的过程中，你的一切决策、全都没有任何可以改进的余地？", "char_start": 562, "char_end": 596}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "注意，这不是在问你是不是全都失败了，而是问你如果再来一次，你有没有什么地方有跟之前做得不同的可能？", "char_start": 597, "char_end": 646}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "只要有这个可能，父母很自然会宁可选择把这些成本风险更低的尝试再来一次，而不是直接升级到更极端的办法。这跟你的父母的道德水平、爱心程度没关系，而是一个冰冷的经济性、可靠性问题，一个投资收益问题。哪怕ta们就是你所说的铁石心肠的魔鬼，铁石心肠的魔鬼也会算账、也不会没事冒无谓的风险。", "char_start": 647, "char_end": 786}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "那么，你是如何做到让对方确信“即使再来一次，也不会有任何希望，只能升级到更激烈的手段”的？", "char_start": 787, "char_end": 832}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你的这些做法，真的毫无改变的余地？", "char_start": 833, "char_end": 850}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "赢得不必上学、不必写作业的“权利”，对你为什么这么重要？", "char_start": 851, "char_end": 879}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0384"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我想把女儿送去戒网瘾中心，女儿不同意，以下是我的观点，请问我有错吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“无路可退”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“很明显的一点是，你不是“不论咋样也不想去违法的地方呆着”，而是“哪怕去违法的地方呆着也不要上学、按时写作业、放弃威胁家长”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "很明显的一点是，你不是“不论咋样也不想去违法的地方呆着”，而是“哪怕去违法的地方呆着也不要上学、按时写作业、放弃威胁家长”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 62, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "148a22e8-6aca-5edb-94c3-a2166624e257", "source_ordinal": 1422, "reading_ordinal": 2635, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "真诚的不老实", "published_at": "2024-07-31T08:39:54+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/676fefd84ed511ef948c52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "韦小宝揭开僧袍，那女郎正欲张口呼叫，突见一柄寒光闪闪的匕首指住了自己鼻子，登时张大了嘴，不敢叫出声来。韦小宝笑嘻嘻的道：“小姑娘，你若是乖乖的听话，我不会伤你一根毫毛。否则的话，我只好割下你的鼻子，放你出寺。一个人少了个鼻子，只不过闻不到香气臭气，也没什么大不了，是不是？”那女郎惊怒交集，脸上更无半点血色。韦小宝道：“你听不听话？”那女郎怒极，低声道：“你快杀了我。”韦小宝叹了口气，说道：“如你这般花容月貌，我怎舍得杀你？不过放你走吧，从此我日里夜里都会想着你，非为你害相思病而死不可，那也有伤上天好生之德。”　　那女郎脸上一红，随即又转为苍白。韦小宝道：“那就只有一个法子。我割了你的鼻子，你相", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 3007, "sample_truncated": true}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "什么叫真诚而不老实，研究一下。", "char_start": 3008, "char_end": 3023}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "“真诚”是一种极为大胆、英勇无畏的行为，是敢于把自己的想法、意图、思考方式放在桌面上，任由对方参考决策。没给自己留下任何美化、掩饰的空间，直接省去了对方考察、检验的成本，去除了自己使用伪装、欺骗技术的条件。如果对方有恶意，这就是把最大的先手让给了对方。", "char_start": 3024, "char_end": 3150}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这意味着一种强大的自信——我用不着那些手段，也不怕你利用这些知识对我不利，也不会接受不了这些自我暴露所带来的后果。", "char_start": 3151, "char_end": 3208}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "“老实”呢？完全相反，是基于极端的风险厌恶驱动的选择，体现出当事人一点计划外的风险都不能再承受的脆弱性。", "char_start": 3209, "char_end": 3261}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "那么老兄，我难道不就是“计划外的风险”？", "char_start": 3262, "char_end": 3282}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你既然一点计划外的风险都不能再承受，那么你为什么要来浪费我的时间？", "char_start": 3283, "char_end": 3316}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这么说，你是认定我无能到不可能给你造成任何计划外的风险，对你是一个绝对安全的选择？你是这个意思吗？", "char_start": 3317, "char_end": 3366}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "别跟我说你“相信我的人品”——第一，我对保持你这话里的“人品”没有兴趣；第二，我非常怀疑“仅仅看到美貌就声称相信对方的人品”的人的人品。", "char_start": 3367, "char_end": 3435}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你之所以觉得这样会为你带来机会，是因为你觉得我也无能、脆弱到了不能再承受任何计划外的风险的程度，所以你在兜售你的“低风险性”。", "char_start": 3437, "char_end": 3500}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "谢谢你的好意，如果哪天我真的到了最看重这个特性的时候，我们再联系。", "char_start": 3501, "char_end": 3534}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0384"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：真诚是不是老实呀，都说真诚是必杀技，但那些女的又不喜欢老实人，真的很矛盾哎?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“真诚的不老实”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“韦小宝揭开僧袍，那女郎正欲张口呼叫，突见一柄寒光闪闪的匕首指住了自己鼻子，登时张大了嘴，不敢叫出声来。韦小宝笑嘻嘻的道：“小姑娘，你若是乖乖的听话，我不会伤你一根毫毛。否则的话，我只好割下你的鼻子，放你出寺。一个人少了个鼻子，只不过闻不到香气臭气，也没什么大不了，是不是？”那女郎惊怒交集，脸上更无半点血色。韦小宝道：“你听不听话？”那女郎怒极，低声道：“你快”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "韦小宝揭开僧袍，那女郎正欲张口呼叫，突见一柄寒光闪闪的匕首指住了自己鼻子，登时张大了嘴，不敢叫出声来。韦小宝笑嘻嘻的道：“小姑娘，你若是乖乖的听话，我不会伤你一根毫毛。否则的话，我只好割下你的鼻子，放你出寺。一个人少了个鼻子，只不过闻不到香气臭气，也没什么大不了，是不是？”那女郎惊怒交集，脸上更无半点血色。韦小宝道：“你听不听话？”那女郎怒极，低声道：“你快", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 3007, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
